Ctfloat%20b%20%3D%200.2%3B%5Cn%5Ctfloat%20sum%20%3D%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sum%20%3D%3D%200.3)%3B%20%20%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%80%BC%3A%20%25.10f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sum)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z64xw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6d7cca05\" id=\"u6d7cca05\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5fae213\" id=\"ub5fae213\">⚡⚡</span><span data-lake-id=\"uff12fe19\" id=\"uff12fe19\">浮点数在计算机中以二进制近似存储，存在精度问题，直接使用==比较往往会出错</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2f098105\" id=\"u2f098105\">❌</span><span data-lake-id=\"u128d8cfd\" id=\"u128d8cfd\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u52fa7f62\" id=\"u52fa7f62\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d173a19\" id=\"u7d173a19\">例如：0.1 + 0.2 != 0.3（实际结果约为0.30000001192092895508）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1f075feb\" id=\"u1f075feb\"><br></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22duolQ%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"sbCKz\" id=\"sbCKz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u259ce054\" id=\"u259ce054\">🐻</span><span data-lake-id=\"u56f8ce18\" id=\"u56f8ce18\">实践练习：</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ufd368fa1\" id=\"ufd368fa1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u625971bd\" id=\"u625971bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">字符比较验证</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%86%E7%8C%9C%E6%B5%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%8F%E5%BF%83%E6%B1%82%E8%AF%81%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2